    "title": "Girls' flag football league launches in Cedar Rapids area - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chelsie Brown ,\n1 days ago HIAWATHA, Iowa (KCRG) - A new league is giving girls in the Cedar Rapids area their first chance to play flag football. Rec United’s inaugural flag football league is open to girls from second through seventh grade in Cedar Rapids, Marion, Hiawatha and Center Point. Many of them have never played football before. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
